{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist Shopify customer testimonial section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT REQUIREMENT: Follow the reference image exactly. Do not redesign, change the card arrangement, introduce additional elements, or create a generic review section.
    
    1. SECTION STRUCTURE
    
    Full-width section.
    
    Background: pure white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 55px.
    
    Vertical padding: 65px.
    
    Minimal, clean, premium editorial design.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    2. TOP HEADER
    
    Create a left-aligned header at the top.
    
    Eyebrow:
    "— LOVED BY PARENTS"
    
    Montserrat Medium.
    
    9px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted olive (#777D5D).
    
    Main heading:
    "Little Ones Approve."
    
    Montserrat Bold.
    
    Font size: 36px desktop.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Line height: 1.2.
    
    Margin below: 22px.
    
    3. NAVIGATION ARROWS
    
    Position two circular navigation buttons at the top-right, aligned horizontally with the heading.
    
    Previous button:
    
    White background.
    
    Thin light-grey border.
    
    Left arrow icon.
    
    Dark olive icon.
    
    Next button:
    
    Dark olive background (#626B4C).
    
    White right arrow icon.
    
    Specifications:
    
    46px × 46px.
    
    Perfect circular shape.
    
    12px gap.
    
    Smooth hover transition.
    
    Functional previous/next navigation.
    
    4. TESTIMONIAL CARDS
    
    Create exactly THREE testimonial cards visible side by side on desktop.
    
    Layout:
    
    Three equal-width columns.
    
    Gap: 18px.
    
    Each card approximately 360px wide and 230px tall.
    
    Background: warm cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Border radius: 17px.
    
    Padding: 26px.
    
    No heavy borders.
    
    No excessive shadows.
    
    All three cards must have identical dimensions and internal layout., CARD 1
    
    Rating:
    ★★★★★
    
    Five small mustard-yellow stars.
    
    Colour: #E7AE2E.
    
    Font size: 14px.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Review:
    "The softest thing my daughter owns. She naps so much better in these, and they still feel brand new after plenty of washes."
    
    Customer information:
    Name: Ananya R.
    Product: Snugly Footies
    
    Avatar:
    
    Circular avatar with initials "AR".
    
    Dark olive background.
    
    White text.
    
    34px diameter.
    
    Product thumbnail:
    
    Small square product image.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Approximately 38px × 38px.
    
    Position at bottom-right.
    
    CARD 2
    
    Rating:
    ★★★★★
    
    Review:
    "Bought the full-sleeve bodysuits for the cooler months and they're perfect — cosy but never sweaty. Lovely stretch, easy to dress."
    
    Customer information:
    Name: Meera K.
    Product: Luxurious Bodysuits
    
    Avatar:
    
    Circular avatar with initials "MK".
    
    Dark olive background.
    
    White text.
    
    34px diameter.
    
    Product thumbnail:
    
    Small square product image.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Approximately 38px × 38px.
    
    Position at bottom-right.
    
    CARD 3
    
    Rating:
    ★★★★★
    
    Review:
    "Free delivery and cash on delivery made it easy to try. The romper is so soft it's now my go-to gift for every baby shower."
    
    Customer information:
    Name: Priya S.
    Product: Cosy Rompers
    
    Avatar:
    
    Circular avatar with initials "PS".
    
    Dark olive background.
    
    White text.
    
    34px diameter.
    
    Product thumbnail:
    
    Small square product image.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Approximately 38px × 38px.
    
    Position at bottom-right.
    
    5. CARD INTERNAL ALIGNMENT
    
    Every testimonial card must follow this exact vertical structure:
    
    Five-star rating at the top-left.
    
    Customer review below the rating.
    
    Thin subtle horizontal divider near the bottom.
    
    Customer avatar and information at the bottom-left.
    
    Small product thumbnail at the bottom-right.
    
    Review typography:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    13px desktop.
    
    Colour: #555849.
    
    Line height: 1.55.
    
    Maximum width: 100%.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: block; width: 100%; background: #fff; color: #343a29; font-family: Montserrat, {{ settings.type_body_font.family }}, sans-serif; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }} * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 65px 55px; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #777d5d; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 2px; line-height: 1.4; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin: 0; color: #626b4c; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 46px; height: 46px; padding: 0; border: 1px solid #deded8; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; color: #626b4c; cursor: pointer; transition: background-color 180ms ease, color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next, .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:hover { background: #626b4c; border-color: #626b4c; color: #fff; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev:hover { color: #fff; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #343a29; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport { overflow: hidden; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; transition: transform 320ms ease; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { min-width: 0; height: 230px; padding: 26px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 17px; background: #f5f3e7; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating { margin: 0 0 11px; color: #e7ae2e; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote { margin: 0; color: #555849; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.55; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__footer { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 40px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(98, 107, 76, .22); }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__avatar { display: flex; flex: 0 0 34px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; background: #626b4c; color: #fff; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__person { min-width: 0; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name { margin: 0; color: #343a29; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-name { margin: 2px 0 0; color: #626b4c; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-image { display: block; flex: 0 0 38px; width: 38px; height: 38px; margin-left: auto; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 6px; background: #e8e5d8; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-image img, .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-image svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #626b4c; outline-offset: 4px; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { padding: 44px 20px; }
    .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header { align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { font-size: 28px; }
    .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
    .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls { gap: 8px; }
    .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
    .ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex: 0 0 100%; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<testimonial-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__header">
      <div><p class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2 class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2></div>
      <div class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls" aria-label="Testimonial navigation">
        <button class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous testimonials"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5M5 12l7-7M5 12l7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
        <button class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next" type="button" aria-label="Next testimonials"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m0 0-7-7m7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Customer testimonials"><div class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track">
      {% for i in (1..3) %}
        {% liquid
          assign quote_key = 'quote_' | append: i
          assign name_key = 'name_' | append: i
          assign initials_key = 'initials_' | append: i
          assign product_name_key = 'product_name_' | append: i
          assign image_key = 'product_image_' | append: i
          assign quote_value = block.settings[quote_key]
          assign name_value = block.settings[name_key]
          assign initials_value = block.settings[initials_key]
          assign product_name_value = block.settings[product_name_key]
          assign product_image_value = block.settings[image_key]
        %}
        <article class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card">
          <p class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</p>
          <p class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__quote">“{{ quote_value | escape }}”</p>
          <div class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__footer">
            <span class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__avatar" aria-hidden="true">{{ initials_value | escape }}</span>
            <div class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__person"><p class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__name">{{ name_value | escape }}</p><p class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-name">{{ product_name_value | escape }}</p></div>
            <div class="ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-image">
              {% if product_image_value != blank %}<img src="{{ product_image_value | image_url: width: 100 }}" alt="{{ product_name_value | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="38" height="38">{% else %}<div>{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div></div>
  </div>
</testimonial-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (() => {
    const tagName = 'testimonial-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
    if (customElements.get(tagName)) return;
    class TestimonialCarousel extends HTMLElement {
      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('.ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track');
        this.cards = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('.ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card'));
        this.index = 0;
        this.querySelector('.ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--prev').addEventListener('click', () => this.move(-1));
        this.querySelector('.ai-testimonials-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next').addEventListener('click', () => this.move(1));
      }
      move(direction) {
        this.index = (this.index + direction + this.cards.length) % this.cards.length;
        const gap = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(this.track).columnGap || getComputedStyle(this.track).gap) || 0;
        this.track.style.transform = `translateX(-${this.index * (this.cards[0].getBoundingClientRect().width + gap)}px)`;
      }
    }
    customElements.define(tagName, TestimonialCarousel);
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Customer testimonials",
  "tag": null,
  "class": "customer-testimonials-block",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
